{"version":1,"content":"<p>【災情拆解 ㊙️】知名拆解評測機構 iFixit 發表「iPhone Duo」完整拆解報告，iFixit 給予該機 5 分（滿分 10 分），創下歷來摺疊機型的最高分紀錄。</p><p>然而，報告同時發出嚴正警告：結合電腦斷層掃描（CT）與 3D 結構建模分析，iFixit 發現鉸鏈中段支撐結構存在受力過度集中的機械缺陷，鉸鏈應力盲點或成首波「屏幕災情」元兇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:22.016336+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:39:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T18:58:07.779052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067985+00:00","content_hash":"5f0748e4125294e53d40953ceeaba1bc0c4de14f3c6bf303982f257748d843f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}